{"binary": "WGF11Compute.exe", "group": "AppendConsume\\CS", "reason": "CrossOver's DXMT v0.72 dereferences null (read of 0x8) in its d3d11.dll at RVA 0x1407e2, called from 0x3f6bc, on a DXMT thread, and the process dies with 0xc0000005 before the case reports (+seh: identical address and stack for AppendConsume\\CS case 1 and UAV\\CounterUAV\\CS case 7).  Neptune's DXMT v0.80 runs these cases.  Every case of the group crashes, so the runner's per-case recovery spends ~270 s for nothing.", "evidence": "WGF11Compute in the CrossOver DXMT full sweep of 2026-10-24: the report's crashed_cases for the group"}
